    {
      "source_key": "ea2efbe7f9a763e322f96f8e42b83fa4d41939d0dabc830cea92412f06c56ca1",
      "raw_block_sha256": "a1c6902e510889c83f5684f530919c1324b6adc795f1a655dbf30c6fef92d563",
      "operative_body": "That Development Variance Permit No. DVP17-0024 be issued by the Council for the City of Langford to Jared Steingard of Westbrook Consulting Ltd on behalf of David Wolovitz to vary one rear yard setback, one exterior yard setback, and two lot width regulations at 2647 Crystalview Dr subject to the following terms and conditions: 1. Appendix The site shall be developed in accordance with the site plan attached (Appendix A). 2. Variances The following regulations of Zoning Bylaw No. 300 are varied under Section 498 of the Local Government Act: a) That Section 6.21.02(3) is varied by reducing the lot width of proposed Lot 2 from the required 16 m (52.5 ft) to 14.58 m (47.8 ft); b) That Section 6.21.02(3) is varied by reducing the lot width of proposed Lot 1 from the required 16 m (52.5 ft) to 14.77 m (48.4 ft); c) That Section 6.21.06(1)(a) is varied by reducing the rear yard setback of proposed Lot 2 from the required 6 m (20 ft) to 3m (10 ft); and d) That Section 6.21.06(1)(c) is varied by reducing the exterior side yard setback of proposed Lot 2 from the required 4.5 m (15 ft) to 3.0 m (10 ft). 3. Conditions The following requirements are imposed under Section 498 of the Local Government Act: a) That the site is developed in accordance with the plan attached to the Planning, Zoning and Affordable Housing Report dated 23 October 2017 as Appendix A.",
